    {
      "text": "Moses was very meek, Num. 12:3. meek will he guide in judgment, Ps. 25:9. meek shall inherit the earth, Ps. 37:11 (Matt. 5:5; 3 Ne. 12:5; D&C 88:17). God arose … to save all the meek, Ps. 76:9. reprove with equity for the meek, Isa. 11:4 (2 Ne. 21:4; 30:9). meek also shall increase their joy in the Lord, Isa. 29:19. preach good tidings unto the meek, Isa. 61:1. Seek ye the Lord, all ye meek, Zeph. 2:3.",
