      "text": "learn of me; for I am meek, Matt. 11:29. thy King cometh unto thee, meek, Matt. 21:5. by the meekness and gentleness of Christ, 2 Cor. 10:1. Meekness … against such there is no law, Gal. 5:23. Put on therefore … meekness, Col. 3:12. follow after … patience, meekness, 1 Tim. 6:11. In meekness instructing those that oppose, 2 Tim. 2:25. receive with meekness the engrafted word, James 1:21. let him shew … his works with meekness of wisdom, James 3:13. ornament of a meek and quiet spirit, 1 Pet. 3:4. reason of the hope that is in you with meekness, 1 Pet. 3:15.",
